   "n": 1,
   "text": "Claude just got 280 free AI specialists.",
   "start": 0.05,
   "end": 2.87
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "text": "It's like a whole company living inside Claude.",
   "start": 3.06,
   "end": 5.45
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "text": "It's called Agency Agents, with over 160,000 stars on GitHub.",
   "start": 5.64,
   "end": 9.56
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "text": "One writes your cold emails.",
   "start": 9.75,
   "end": 11.23
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "text": "A sales team preps your calls.",
   "start": 11.42,
   "end": 12.98
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "text": "A dev team builds the product.",
   "start": 13.17,
   "end": 14.88
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "text": "More agents run your social media and support.",
   "start": 15.07,
   "end": 17.49
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "text": "But the craziest one is the boss agent.",
   "start": 17.68,
   "end": 19.58
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "text": "It hands the work to the right specialist and checks every step.",
   "start": 19.77,
   "end": 22.52
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "text": "You can add them all, or just one.",
   "start": 22.71,
   "end": 24.34
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "text": "The setup's in the link in bio.",
   "start": 24.53,
   "end": 26.34
  },
  {
